# site.js

All customer copy, nav, schema, and page HTML live in this file. Edit the objects. Do not scatter copy into HTML shells.

- `BUSINESS` — contact and identity. Use the values already in this object; do not invent new ones.
- `SERVICES` — per-slug copy. `urgent` only on lekkage/spoed.
- `PRIMARY_SERVICE_SLUGS` — `dakdekken` only. Uses `servicePage`.
- `ADDITIONAL_SERVICE_SLUGS` — simpler `additionalServicePage` plus `noindex,follow` in `setMeta`. Do not move slugs between lists unless asked.
- `PROJECTS` — plaats, dienst, `before`, `work`, resultaat, CTA, alt. Stay empty until Luca supplies approved cases.
- `WORK_PHOTOS` — real job photos with honest alts. No invented places.
- `REVIEWS`, `FAQS`, `PRICE_FACTORS`, `PAGE_META`

Rules inside this file:

- Escape interpolated strings with `escapeHtml`.
- Contact and offerte forms post to Web3Forms. Do not revert them to mailto.
- FAQ JSON-LD only on home and contact (where FAQ markup is visible).
- `RoofingContractor` schema on every page; `Service` schema on service pages.
- Keep phone + WhatsApp CTAs and the sticky mobile footer.
